{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00453","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤云旦起，鸟星昏集。\n律候新风，阳开初蛰。\n至德可飨，行潦斯挹。\n锡以无疆，蒸人乃粒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}